msgctxt ""
"\n    OneSpace is a workspace for doing legitimate work. This policy "
"exists to\n    keep it usable for everybody on it and to keep us on the "
"right side of the\n    law and of the suppliers we depend on. It binds "
"your organisation and every\n    person who signs in.\n"
msgid "aup"
msgstr "Nutzungsrichtlinie"

msgctxt ""
"\n    Where we can, we will tell you and give you a chance to put it "
"right. Where\n    the breach is serious, ongoing, or exposes other "
"customers, we may remove\n    content or suspend access first and "
"explain afterwards. We report to the\n    authorities what the law "
"requires us to report.\n"
msgid "aup"
msgstr "Nutzungsrichtlinie"

