msgstr "Kunde"

msgid "database"
msgstr "Datenbank"

msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    Everybody at Four Degree Labs with access to customer data is "
"bound by\n    confidentiality obligations, and access is limited to "
"those who need it to\n    run the service or to answer a support request "
"you have raised.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    If we become aware of a personal data breach affecting your data "
"we will\n    tell you without undue delay, and in any event within "
"seventy-two hours, and\n    give you what we know: what happened, which "
"data, how many people, what we\n    are doing about it, and who to talk "
"to.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    We keep appropriate technical and organisational measures: "
"transport\n    encryption everywhere, encryption at rest for stored "
"objects and backups,\n    per-workspace isolation with a separate "
"database per workspace, access\n    control inside the product that "
"follows the framework's own permission\n    model, credentials held as "
"secrets and never written into a workspace,\n    daily backups held in a "
"second location, and audit records of administrative\n    action.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    We process personal data only on your documented instructions, "
"which the\n    Terms of Service and your use of the product's features "
"are. If we are\n    required by law to process it otherwise, we will "
"tell you first unless the\n    law forbids that.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    We will answer reasonable questions about our processing and "
"provide the\n    information you need to show compliance. Where an audit "
"is legally required,\n    we will agree its scope and timing with you "
"first, once in any twelve-month\n    period unless a supervisory "
"authority requires otherwise, and at your cost.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    When the agreement ends you can export your data, and the "
"lifecycle in the\n    Terms of Service says how long the workspace "
"remains restorable. After that\n    we delete it, including from backups "
"as those backups expire on their normal\n    schedule. We will confirm "
"deletion in writing if you ask.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    Where personal data is transferred out of the United Arab "
"Emirates, we rely\n    on the transfer mechanisms the UAE Personal Data "
"Protection Law provides —\n    an adequate jurisdiction, or contractual "
"safeguards. Where it is transferred\n    out of the European Economic "
"Area or the United Kingdom, we rely on the\n    European Commission's "
"Standard Contractual Clauses and the UK Addendum, and\n    our "
"subprocessors are engaged on the same basis.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

msgctxt ""
"\n    You give general authorisation for us to use subprocessors. Every "
"current\n    one is listed in the Subprocessors document, which is part "
"of this\n    addendum, and each is engaged under terms no less "
"protective than these. We\n    remain responsible to you for what they "
"do.\n"
msgid "dpa"
msgstr "Auftragsverarbeitung"

