"created, and\n    files in the object-storage location that goes with "
"it. Some of our\n    suppliers operate globally; where data leaves the "
"United Arab Emirates or\n    the European Economic Area, it does so "
"under the transfer terms described in\n    the Data Processing "
"Addendum.\n"
